        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Experiment with the point of view of a passage of your own writing. First, circle words that name characters/topics, wherever they appear. Then underline the subject of every clause. You should see that some characters/topics appear most often as subjects, while others appear most often in other parts of your sentences (likely after the verb). Revise the passage by using those other characters/topics as subjects and by moving characters/topics used as subjects after the verb. What changes do you notice in the feel or even meaning of the passage?",
            "block_bbox": [
                115,
                354,
                772,
                521
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 7,
            "global_block_id": 7,
