        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In Lessons 2 and 3, we noted that in clear sentences, the story (characters, actions) aligns with the grammar (subjects, verbs). In this lesson, we added an additional consideration: how to organize the information in a series of sentences so that they not only are clear individually but also connect one to another and hang together as a whole.",
            "block_bbox": [
